    "verified_before_and_after_remote_tests": true
  },
  "changes": [
    "Prefill queued preparation and committed ownership no longer retain RouteReservation lifecycle; selection validation and mutation are State-owned.",
    "DecodeResources contains immutable public resource identities and views; DecodeState does not depend on the workflow Endpoint API. This type migration is not counted as deletion.",
    "Exact generation/reservation preemption claims freeze the cancellation target before RPC; no token-only ownership fallback.",
    "One CleanupProgress retains local ledger settlement facts through terminal publication, pending delivery proof, retries, inactivity, and archival.",
    "Only unstarted cleanup tasks are coalesced by QUEUED. Executor submission is outside Context; rejected submissions restore the queue claim under Context. Accepted running notifications remain visible to shutdown drain.",
    "Initial Worker terminal, generation retirement, priority completion and successful FINISHED reconciliation transfer already-applied ledger facts into first cleanup; ACTIVE and cancel ACK do not imply resource terminal.",
    "Prefill completion facts are retained regardless of whether Decode acceptance arrives first. Handoff deadlines are installed only before Decode acceptance.",
    "All three Context preemption resource reconciliations now use the callback-free ledger operation. Capacity notifications and frozen terminal/ACK effects run outside Context; notification failure does not skip effects.",
    "Empty-queue projection with disabled execution prediction budget uses singleton completion directly, removing probe/features, ProjectedQueue, Selection and selection-list allocation. Positive budgets and live queues retain the generic planner."
  ],
  "reviews": [
    {
      "agent": "state_boundary_review",
      "result": "No remaining blocking finding in reviewed resource/cleanup/queue/retirement scope on sealed source. Audited every FINISHED reconciliation and first vs existing cleanup."
    },
    {
      "agent": "lock_contract_review",
      "result": "No remaining blocking finding in reviewed Context/resource lock, notification, generation pin retirement, executor acceptance/rejection/drain and archival scope on sealed source."
    },
    {
      "agent": "regression_hotspot_review",
      "result": "No remaining blocking finding in reviewed final facts, cleanup queue, source identity and projection equivalence scope on sealed source. Independently verified final changed files against the manifest."
    }
